==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features the [[Galarian form]] of {{p|Mr. Mime}}.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Darkness Ablaze|Galarian Mr. Mime|35}} from the {{TCG|Darkness Ablaze}} expansion; both cards have the Icy Snow attack.
*'''Icy Snow''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Next Destinies|Vanillite|31}} and {{TCG ID|Next Destinies|Vanillish|32}} from the {{TCG|Next Destinies}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

